{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "You two get him to a doctor.\nThere's something I still need to do here.": "",
  "Guess I'm joining your little party.": "",
  "Not even the threat of death\ncan stop you guys.": "",
  "You stubborn boys...\nNot even the threat of death stops you.": "",
  "Took you long enough.": "",
  "At least you understand now, boss.": "",
  "Hey. It's about time\nyou give us some answers.": "",
  "Hey. It's about time we got\nsome answers.": "",
  "I'm done wasting time on you,\nso just cooperate and it'll all be fine.": "",
  "I'm done wasting time on you,\nso I suggest you cooperate.": "",
  "Ngh...": "",
  "What, your murderer friend abandon you?\nNot much use if he won't come when you need help.": "",
  "Don't tell me the Mole abandoned you?\nNot much use if he won't come when you need help.": "",
  "Boss, listen. Things're gonna\nget ugly if I die here.": "",
  "Boss... If I die here,\nthis is gonna get even uglier.": "",
  "Neither of you will survive the aftermath.\nIt's not too late to put a stop to this.": "",
  "Neither of you will survive the aftermath.\nIt's not too late to stop this.": "",
  "Just end this fucker\nand be done with it.": "",
  "And if I don't, the Mole will kill us both?\nIs that what you're saying?": "",
  "And if I don't, what do you imagine will happen?\nThe Mole will come to kill us both?": "",
  "Look. Some people you can get away\nwith betraying, and some people you can't.": "",
  "Some people in this world... you can get\naway with betraying. And some people you can't.": "",
  "And which am I, I wonder?": "",
  "Pick your poison, Hamura. You die betraying\nthe Mole, or you die defending him.": "",
  "You can die betraying the Mole,\nor die defending him. What'll it be?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This oughta be good.)</color>": "",
  "We're going to bring\nthis murderer to justice.": "",
  "We'll bring the Mole to justice.": "",
  "Now tell me where I can find him.\nAnd his identity.": "",
  "Answer me!": "",
  "If you want to live, answer me!": "",
  "I'd rather die.": "",
  "Don't play dumb with me.\nYou think I'm gonna talk that easy!?": "",
  "Don't play dumb.\nYou think I'm gonna talk that easy!?": "",
  "Huh. Didn't think you'd\nreally stand your ground.": "",
  "I'm kind of impressed.\nDidn't think you'd stand your ground.": "",
  "We can't stay here.\nWho knows when his backup might arrive.": "",
  "We can't stay here for much longer.\nWho knows when his backup might arrive.": "",
  "Are the Matsugane still after us?": "",
  "Most likely.\nEmbarrassing as that is to admit.": "",
  "Most likely, yes. Though as the patriarch,\nit's embarrassing to admit.": "",
  "Well, guess we've gotta figure out\nhow to make you talk.": "",
  "...Guess we've gotta figure out\nhow to make you talk.": "",
  "Luckily, I've got a place in mind.\nYou heard of the Honmaruen cabaret?": "",
  "Luckily, I've got a place in mind.\nYou know the Honmaruen cabaret?": "",
  "It's a Kyorei stronghold.": "",
  "It's a Kyorei Clan stronghold.": "",
  "I'm sure your former prey\nwill be thrilled to see you.": "",
  "I'm sure the Mole's former prey\nwill be thrilled to see you.": "",
  "If they can't break you, I don't know what can.\nI doubt you'll last, though.": "",
  "It'll be damn interesting\neither way.": "",
  "Now c'mon. Let's go.": "",
  "Now. Let's go!": "",
  "Here he is, the man of the hour.\nGlad you could make it, Hamura.": "",
  "Glad you could make it, Hamura!\nYou're the man of the hour, y'know?": "",
  "And you must be Patriarch Matsugane?\nIt's a pleasure to meet you.": "",
  "And you must be Patriarch Matsugane?\nIt's a real pleasure.": "",
  "Though if you ask me, Tojo leadership should be\nbetter at keeping their dogs chained up.": "",
  "Though if you ask me, the Tojo Clan\noughta keep its dogs on tighter leashes.": "",
  "Agreed. There is no excuse\nfor how I acted.": "",
  "Agreed.\nI make no excuses.": "",
  "Shioya-san.": "",
  "We're gonna make Hamura tell us who the Mole is.\nThink you can keep us safe 'til then?": "",
  "Heh. Maybe, maybe not.": "",
  "This is what Chairman Kajihira wants.": "",
  "Let me remind you, this is what\nChairman Kajihira wants.": "",
  "You don't wanna disobey\nhis orders, do you?": "",
  "You're not gonna go rogue, are you?": "",
  "Well that's rude.": "",
  "Now that's just rude, Yagami.": "",
  "I still haven't paid you back for what you did to me.\nIf you don't mind, I'd like to settle that first.": "",
  "I still haven't paid you back for what you did to me.\nIf it's all the same, how 'bout we settle it?": "",
  "For what <font_kind=yakuza_italic>I</font_kind> did?\nYou're the one who kidnapped Mafuyu.": "",
  "For what <font_kind=yakuza_italic>I</font_kind> did?\nYou're the one who tried to kidnap Mafuyu.": "",
  "If you ask me,\nyou got what was coming to you.": "",
  "Grr, fine!": "",
  "...Under one condition.": "",
  "We'll play along...\nunder one condition.": "",
  "Once you're done with him...\nyou give Hamura to us.": "",
  "Gladly.": "",
  "All right. Gladly.": "",
  "What, no witty comeback?\nI think that's a first for you.": "",
  "What, no more snarky comments?\nI think that's a first for you.": "",
  "...Shut it.": "",
  "...Shut up.": "",
  "Get your fucking hands off me.": "",
  "This is as good a spot as any. You need\nany... instruments, you just ask me.": "",
  "This is good a spot as any. Just say the word,\nand I'll bring out the \"instruments.\"": "",
  "Hopefully it doesn't come to that.": "",
  "Now, I think it's about time we got some answers.": "",
  "I've been waiting a long time\nto hear some answers from you.": "",
  "And you're gonna give them to us.": "",
  "You're gonna tell me all you know.": "",
  "Should we take it from the top?": "",
  "Let's take it from the top.": "",
  "First off, the one in control of all this...\nis Shono, the AD-9 researcher.": "",
  "First off, the one in control of all this...\nthe AD-9 researcher, Shono.": "",
  "How long have you been working for him?\nMurdering for him?": "",
  "You've been working for him. For how long?\nWhat brought you into contact?": "",
  "I already have a pretty good idea.\nHow about I guess?": "",
  "I already have a pretty good idea myself.\nHow about I guess?": "",
  "The first time you used the Mole was...": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan guys\nwho turned up dead.": "",
  "For the Kyorei killings.": "",
  "Their eyes were gouged out\nand the bodies dumped in the alleyways.": "",
  "Murdering members of the Kyorei Clan.\nHunting them down in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Yeah? Real solid detective work there.": "",
  "Sure. Let's go with that.": "",
  "Yo, Yagami. That doesn't feel right.\nI mean, look at that shit-eating grin.": "",
  "Yeah, right. Lemme think here...": "",
  "...At least, that's how you made it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>look</font_kind>.": "",
  "What the shit, man.": "",
  "For fuck's sake...": "",
  "Now, the first time\nyou used the Mole was...": "",
  "Now, the real first time you\nused the Mole was...": "",
  "When you offed Shintani.": "",
  "When you offed a Kamurocho lawyer.": "",
  "You had your man kill him,\nand dump his body in my office.": "",
  "You had your man kill Shintani\nand dump his body in my office.": "",
  "Back it up, you were investigating these murders\nway before that happened, weren't you?": "",
  "Hey, hold up. You were investigatin' the Mole\nway before that happened.": "",
  "You been hitting the bottle, kid?": "",
  "I think you're veerin' off track.": "",
  "I know what I'm doing, Shioya.\nIt's all part of the plan.": "",
  "I know what I'm doing! Don't break my flow here.\nIt's all part of the plan.": "",
  "Like hell it is.": "",
  "Anyway, the first time\nyou used the Mole was...": "",
  "Anyway, the first time you\nused the Mole was...": "",
  "When you murdered Waku-san\nat the ADDC.": "",
  "The case I defended Okubo\nin three years ago.": "",
  "Three years ago. The case\nwhere I defended Okubo.": "",
  "To silence Waku-san in the hospital, Shono hired\nan assassin and... Wait, is that what happened?": "",
  "To silence Waku-san in the hospital, Shono hired\nan assassin and, uh... Wait, hold on.": "",
  "Moving on. The first time you\nused the Mole was...": "",
  "When you murdered Emi Terasawa\nand set her apartment on fire.": "",
  "When you killed a nurse and\nburned her apartment down.": "",
  "Three years ago. She was Shinpei Okubo's\ngirlfriend, as I'm sure you remember.": "",
  "You arranged for the murder of Shinpei Okubo's\ngirlfriend, Emi Terasawa... three years back.": "",
  "You made it look like Okubo killed her.": "",
  "You made it look like\nOkubo killed her.": "",
  "Bullshit I did. Three years ago?\nSure as shit wasn't us.": "",
  "Bullshit I did. You're blowin' smoke.\nThree years ago? Sure as shit wasn't us.": "",
  "Oh... Dammit,\nI guess you're right.": "",
  "Oh, yeah...\nI guess you're right.": "",
  "Head in the game, Yagami.": "",
  "Get serious!": "",
  "For Hashiki, the vice director of the ADDC.": "",
  "When you murdered the vice director\nof the ADDC.": "",
  "He got beat to death six months ago,\nas you well know.": "",
  "Six months ago, Toru Hashiki\nwas beaten to death.": "",
  "Hashiki had a secret deal\nwith Chairman Kajihira.": "",
  "Together they were gonna poke holes in this AD-9\nbusiness and bring the ADDC to its knees.": "",
  "They'd poison the ADDC from the inside,\nand shut down AD-9 for good.": "",
  "But Shono, the researcher in charge of the drug,\nhad a big secret he needed to keep hidden.": "",
  "But... Shono, the researcher in charge of the drug,\nhad a secret he needed to keep hidden.": "",
  "Hashiki's little investigation\nposed a big problem...": "",
  "Hashiki's little investigation\nposed a big problem for Shono...": "",
  "That is, until he got beaten down\nin the back streets of Kamurocho.": "",
  "Or at least it did. Until he got beaten down\nin the back streets of Kamurocho.": "",
  "Hashiki was fatally wounded by the Mole,\nbut survived for another three weeks.": "",
  "The Mole fatally wounded Hashiki,\nbut he survived for another three weeks.": "",
  "That kept suspicion off Shono.\nAnd left practically no evidence.": "",
  "Only the most skilled killer could\npull something like that off.": "",
  "Only the most skilled killer\ncould pull something like that off.": "",
  "In other words...\nThe assassin you and Shono have been using.": "",
  "You and Shono know him well.\nThe assassin known as the Mole.": "",
  "Heh, think you struck a nerve.": "",
  "Think you struck a nerve.": "",
  "You're a real crack detective, Yagami.": "",
  "Yagami, you ain't half bad at this.": "",
  "You know, I personally funded his time at law school.\nHe never would've passed the bar without me.": "",
  "You know, I funded his law school degree.\nHelped him pass the bar, too.": "",
  "No shit? I'd say you made a good investment.\nPayin' off in spades.": "",
  "Whoa, no shit?\nLooks like you made a good investment.": "",
  "Do you mind? I'm kinda in the middle\nof something here.": "",
  "Do you mind?\nI'm in the middle of something.": "",
  "Sorry!": "",
  "You're doing good, Yagami.\nJust lemme know if you need the instruments.": "",
  "You're doin' good, Yagami. Remember, just say the word...\nand I'll bring out some of my favorite toys.": "",
  "Tak. What are you going to ask next?": "",
  "Tak. What are you going to\nask Hamura next?": "",
  "Who the Mole is. Hamura's the only one\nwho knows his true identity.": "",
  "Who the Mole is. The only one who knows\nhis identity... is Hamura himself.": "",
  "So. Where's your friend?": "",
  "So where's the Mole?": "",
  "No clue... but he'll be here soon enough.\nAll three of you are dead where you stand.": "",
  "No clue... but he'll be here soon enough.\nYou three are dead men walking.": "",
  "He says the Mole's on his way here.": "",
  "Oh is he now!? I'd love to have\na \"chat\" with the lad...": "",
  "Heh, let him come.\nI could use a new punching bag.": "",
  "Keep dreaming, pal. He'd wipe the floor\nwith your backcountry ass.": "",
  "Enough, Hamura. Tell us who the Mole is.\nAnd how you started working with him.": "",
  "Tell us who the Mole is. Is he just a killer?\nHow did you start working with him?": "",
  "Have those instruments handy?": "",
  "Got those instruments?": "",
  "Comin' right up!": "",
  "All right, all right!\nI'll talk!": "",
  "Fine, I'll talk! Calm down...": "",
  "That's almost a shame!\nI like when it's tool time.": "",
  "Aw, caved already?\nOver before it began!": "",
  "Now, who is the Mole?": "",
  "...At first, he was just an informant feeding\noff the chaos that breeds in Kamurocho like flies.": "",
  "The Mole... At first, he was just an informant.\nFeeding off the chaos that is Kamurocho.": "",
  "An informant?": "",
  "Yup. And he was trained by one\nof the best in the business.": "",
  "Yup. A good one. Trained by\none of the best in the business.": "",
  "Rose to prominence after the cops busted his mentor,\nand that made the Mole the top guy in the biz.": "",
  "But the cops finally busted his mentor.\nAnd the Mole filled the gap when he was gone.": "",
  "One of those situations where the student surpassed\nthe master. Nobody could beat his intel.": "",
  "Turns out, the student had become the master.\nThe guy had the best info in town.": "",
  "Could get his hands on anything you needed, too.\nGuns, forged documents, you name it.": "",
  "Guns, forged documents, you name it.\nHe could supply whatever you wanted.": "",
  "Before long we'd formed a nice little partnership.\nStarted making a name for ourselves.": "",
  "Before long, we'd formed a nice little partnership\nand made a name for ourselves.": "",
  "Thinking about it...\nIt's been about 20 years now.": "",
  "Think it's been about...\ntwenty years now.": "",
  "And?\nKeep talking, or it's tools.": "",
  "Yeah? Keep going.": "",
  "Once I got the gig as captain of the Matsugane Family,\nI started relying on him even more.": "",
  "Once I got the gig as Matsugane Family captain,\nI relied on the Mole even more.": "",
  "Lemme tell you, the guy could dispose of a corpse\nlike it was the easiest damn thing in the world.": "",
  "Lemme tell you, guy could dispose of a corpse fast.\nLike it was the easiest damn thing in the world.": "",
  "He had nerves of steel.\nAnd he's never even sworn up.": "",
  "He had nerves of steel.\nAnd he never even swore up.": "",
  "Flash forward to a couple years ago.\nHe said he was ready to start doing hits.": "",
  "Then, couple years ago.\nHe said he was ready to do hits.": "",
  "That was when my big chance finally came.": "",
  "So I figured...\nIt was time to go big.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So it was the Mole who brought\nassassinations to the table.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Who's the real yakuza here?)</color>": "",
  "Honestly, I wasn't that big\non the whole murder thing.": "",
  "If I'm bein' honest,\nhits weren't my thing.": "",
  "But the dangerous shit's\nwhat really brings in the cash.": "",
  "But... that dangerous shit\nbrings in the real cash.": "",
  "So, I started touting his \"services\"\naround the darker side of Kamurocho.": "",
  "So, I started spreading his \"services\"\naround the darker side of Kamurocho.": "",
  "Felt like I'd added a new dish to my menu.": "",
  "Felt like I'd added a new dish\nto my menu.": "",
  "This is no time for jokes, you fool.": "",
  "What, you don't approve of my methods?": "",
  "This city'll swallow you whole\nif you don't got the cash.": "",
  "Cash is how you survive in this city.\nOr Kamurocho'll open wide and swallow you whole.": "",
  "And protecting the family name\ndoesn't come cheap.": "",
  "And I had to protect the family name.\nThat ain't cheap.": "",
  "You think Kaito could have toughed it out\nwith all his swagger? We'd've vanished by now.": "",
  "If all we'd had was Kaito's \"swagger,\"\nthe family would be dust.": "",
  "But with enough money who knows?\nWe coulda rode it to the top of the Tojo Clan.": "",
  "But with enough money, who knows?\nWe coulda become a direct Tojo Clan family.": "",
  "Wasn't that always part of the dream, boss?": "",
  "Right, boss?\nWasn't that always the dream?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Took you long enough.": "กว่าจะมาถึงก็นานเชียวนะ",
  "Ngh...": "อึก...",
  "Answer me!": "ตอบมา!",
  "Gladly.": "ยินดีเลย",
  "For fuck's sake...": "แม่งเอ๊ย...",
  "Get serious!": "จริงจังหน่อยสิ!",
  "Sorry!": "ขอโทษ!",
  "Comin' right up!": "มาเดี๋ยวนี้เลย!"
 }
}
